<title>DENMARK: Danish ISS posts 1997 six-month profit.</title>
<headline>Danish ISS posts 1997 six-month profit.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result		83  vs  -2.029 billion</p>
<p> Group operating result     268  vs  241</p>
<p> Group net turnover    5.757 billion  vs 5.237 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish cleaning group is International Service System A/S (ISS). It said in a statement that it forecast full year 1997 turnover and operating profit eight percent up on 1996. The result was in line with analyst expectations.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
